/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T12:16:26-07:00","id":1089308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1089284-has-anyone-done-anything-with-the-ww2-pantheons-outside-of-the-ww2-period?p=1089306#post1089306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not specifically set in WW2, but I did have an idea for a Scion of Uncle Sam who clubs titanspawn with a relic baseball bat. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;America would like a few volunteers.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T13:02:01-07:00","id":1089329,"title":"","content":"My take on the &quot;American Pantheon&quot; is to not have a full Pantheon, but a group of Demigods from different Pantheons who are trying to forge their own Pantheon, but haven't yet.<br /> <br /> - Uncle Samuel Wilson, Son of Tyr, Would be God of Patriotism, the US Military, and Service to Country<br /> - Rosie the Riveter, Daughter of Brighid, Would be Goddess of the Labor Movement and Feminism (she's the <a href=\"http://www.militarytrader.com/wp-content/uploads/il_fullxfull.508201205_1gbw.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">real Rosie</a> by the way)<br /> - Bass Reeves - the Lone Ranger, Son of Horus, Would be God of Justice<br /> - Harriet Tubman, Chosen of Eshu Elegba (in a Christian synchronized mantle), Would be Goddess of Liberation<br /> - Johnny &quot;Appleseed&quot; Chapman, Son of Whiskey Jack, Would be God of the Land's Bounty<br /> - Pecos Bill, Son of Zeus, Would be God of the Frontier and Exploration (currently an Astronaut)<br /> - Marilyn Monroe, Sacrificial Incarnate of Ishtar, Would be Goddess of Hollywood and the Cult of Celebrity<br /> <br /> -Johnny Reb, Incarnate of Attar, Would be God of Rebellion (and White Supremacy) [Sam and the black members of the Pantheon don't accept him as a member, but he's fatebound to them as an adversary]<br /> <br /> A few other candidates if you want to use multiple origins from the same Pantheons<br /> <br /> - Andrew Carnegie, Chosen of Daghda, Would be God of Bootstraps, Capitalism, Philanthropy (and Robber Barons)<br /> - Amelia Earhart, Chosen of Odin (meant to be a Valkyrie, but she went rogue), Would be Psychopomp of the Pantheon<br /> - Nikolai Tesla, Adopted Son of Hephaestus (bio-son of Zeus), Would be God of Science and Invention [has been entrusted with Franklin's Key, Franklin has been missing since the even of the Civil War]<br /> - Br'er Rabbit, Lesser Divinity with ancestral ties to both Anansi and Nanabozho, doesn't claim a potential domain but is a trouble maker/culture hero of the group... he's increasingly Bugs Bunny<br /> - Captain Alfred Bulltrop Stormalong, Son of Njord, Would be God of Sailors, the Sea's Bounty, and American Maritime Power<br /> <br /> <br /> -Columbia is not a Demigoddess - she's a Mantle of Athena, and acts as the patron to the group (Athena is also Britannia and Marianne - Western Democracy has been her pet project trying to get it right since the days of Classical Athens)<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 05-07-2017, 04:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T15:53:12-07:00","id":1089436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1089284-has-anyone-done-anything-with-the-ww2-pantheons-outside-of-the-ww2-period?p=1089329#post1089329\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-Johnny Reb, Incarnate of Attar, Would be God of Rebellion (and White Supremacy) [Sam and the black members of the Pantheon don't accept him as a member, but he's fatebound to them as an adversary]<br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Considering white supremacy was a heavy part of American culture for centuries and continues to remain prevalent throughout society decades after the civil rights acts, I would think Harriet Tubman would have been the odd one out.<br /> <br /> <br /> That's why I think a 'yankee' pantheon would have a lot of historical beef with most of the other pantheons (Native American, Voodoo, Japanese, Aztec, pretty much any ethnic group who isn't white).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 05-07-2017, 06:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T17:12:40-07:00","id":1089477,"title":"","content":"Certainly, but Johnny Reb is the god worshipped by those fighting for its preservation.<br /> <br /> (Also Harriet isn't the only black demigod in the group. So is Bass Reeves, the Lone Ranger)<br /> <br /> <br /> I agree if the pantheon already existed, it would have a lot to answer for. My pitch is that it's something new that's gradually been forming via alliances of American Scions of other Pantheons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 05-07-2017, 08:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T01:59:48-07:00","id":1089652,"title":"","content":"I've also been using the American Pantheon as a Group of Demigod from all over the Place. I'm Torn on Making John Henry tied to Thor, one of the Slavic Gods to tie him to precommunism, or Shango.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T02:46:29-07:00","id":1089668,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1089284-has-anyone-done-anything-with-the-ww2-pantheons-outside-of-the-ww2-period?p=1089652#post1089652\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've also been using the American Pantheon as a Group of Demigod from all over the Place. I'm Torn on Making John Henry tied to Thor, one of the Slavic Gods to tie him to precommunism, or Shango.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You know, the more I think about it, the more I like Thor in the role. He was a patron of common workers and freemen. &quot;Freemen&quot; has special resonance for a black figure from the Reconstruction Era, ontop of its normal class association.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>C